WEBVTT

00:20.395 --> 00:22.147
<i>Isn't this where...</i>

00:25.692 --> 00:27.944
Quit spacing out!

00:28.987 --> 00:30.363
Shut up, you jerk!

00:32.824 --> 00:33.908
Just give up already!

00:33.908 --> 00:36.327
You've lost, you bastard, Kisaki!

00:39.122 --> 00:40.415
Since you're weak,

00:40.415 --> 00:42.959
you make other people
be your sword and shield!

00:42.959 --> 00:45.462
Moebius! Valhalla! Tenjiku!

00:46.087 --> 00:49.299
You're a coward
who can't do anything on your own!

00:49.299 --> 00:51.551
Don't be stupid!

00:51.551 --> 00:55.513
To be a leader of men,
you don't need physical strength!

01:08.485 --> 01:10.111
To achieve anything,

01:10.111 --> 01:14.657
what you need is the perfect plan
worked out in intricate detail.

01:15.742 --> 01:17.494
The perfect plan?

01:20.997 --> 01:24.834
How can you call it a perfect plan
when someone like me can stop it?

01:24.834 --> 01:26.377
Shut up!

01:29.172 --> 01:32.425
I was supposed to become the dark hero.

01:33.384 --> 01:37.597
My first plan was to kill Draken,
take over the number two spot,

01:37.597 --> 01:39.516
and manipulate Toman from the shadows.

01:40.141 --> 01:43.353
My second plan was to build Valhalla,
which had no leader,

01:43.895 --> 01:47.065
destroy Toman,
and install Mikey as its leader.

01:49.067 --> 01:52.904
My third plan was
to sic Tenjiku on Toman and destroy it,

01:52.904 --> 01:56.699
manipulate Mikey,
and gain control of the underworld.

02:00.453 --> 02:02.831
They were all perfect plans.

02:02.831 --> 02:04.791
There was no way to crush them.

02:08.086 --> 02:10.421
Except for one possibility.

02:18.429 --> 02:19.514
Even now...

02:23.268 --> 02:25.395
Even now, I remember it clearly.

02:27.522 --> 02:28.648
<i>The raging flames.</i>

02:29.732 --> 02:31.234
<i>The rising black smoke.</i>

02:32.652 --> 02:34.821
<i>As I watched, I swore...</i>

02:44.581 --> 02:47.876
I swore to become the leader of Toman.

02:50.044 --> 02:53.047
This is the place, Kisaki.

02:55.967 --> 02:57.969
This is where, in the future,

02:58.887 --> 03:01.181
you murdered Hinata Tachibana.

03:06.895 --> 03:10.231
I've jumped between the future and past
over and over in this battle.

03:15.153 --> 03:18.406
Let's settle it right here, Kisaki.

04:52.333 --> 04:55.420
Let's settle it right here, Kisaki.

04:59.674 --> 05:01.843
I swear I'll end this.

05:02.927 --> 05:04.012
Right here!

05:06.431 --> 05:07.890
<i>Huh?</i>

05:08.850 --> 05:09.892
<i>What was that just now?</i>

05:13.313 --> 05:15.398
<i>Hina...</i>

05:16.482 --> 05:18.901
I knew it.

05:21.029 --> 05:24.615
You've been traveling through time.

05:28.995 --> 05:31.831
Who'd have thought
you really were a time traveler.

05:32.415 --> 05:35.293
I get it now. So that's what it was.

05:35.293 --> 05:37.920
So that's how you did it.

05:37.920 --> 05:39.005
Kisaki,

05:39.589 --> 05:41.716
why are you so obsessed with Hina?

05:45.928 --> 05:50.683
You're attached to Mikey,
so I can understand why you want Toman.

05:51.601 --> 05:54.062
But why do you kill Hina every time?

05:57.106 --> 05:59.067
Answer me! Why kill her?

06:04.030 --> 06:05.114
I'm sorry.

06:05.907 --> 06:07.867
<i>That's Hina.</i>

06:11.371 --> 06:12.830
<i>What the heck is going on?</i>

06:13.915 --> 06:15.041
I see.

06:17.877 --> 06:18.878
So...

06:20.004 --> 06:21.714
I failed.

06:27.970 --> 06:30.056
<i>It's that scene again.</i>

06:31.724 --> 06:34.060
<i>It's Hina and Kisaki.</i>

06:42.443 --> 06:43.653
I'm sorry.

06:50.034 --> 06:51.035
Huh?

06:57.500 --> 06:58.918
<i>What the heck is that?</i>

06:59.502 --> 07:01.671
<i>Is that a ring?</i>

07:02.296 --> 07:06.092
<i>Did Kisaki confess his love for Hina
in this spot in the future?</i>

07:07.760 --> 07:08.803
Kisaki...

07:11.764 --> 07:15.143
Don't tell me you're in love with...

07:29.449 --> 07:30.616
When I was...

07:31.826 --> 07:35.663
<i>in elementary school,
I was called a child prodigy.</i>

07:36.080 --> 07:37.123
Kisaki!

07:37.123 --> 07:40.334
You're amazing! You placed first
on the practice exams again!

07:41.919 --> 07:43.546
It was just luck.

07:44.755 --> 07:46.799
Wow! So humble!

07:46.799 --> 07:49.051
- Let's go, Hina.
- Hmm?

07:51.929 --> 07:55.308
<i>I pretended not to notice her,</i>

07:55.933 --> 07:58.186
<i>but I was in love with Hinata Tachibana.</i>

07:58.769 --> 08:02.273
<i>And I believed that Hinata Tachibana
was naturally in love with me,</i>

08:02.273 --> 08:03.524
<i>the child prodigy.</i>

08:04.192 --> 08:05.526
<i>But then,</i>

08:05.526 --> 08:08.279
<i>one day, a hero suddenly showed up</i>

08:08.279 --> 08:10.406
<i>and stole her heart.</i>

08:17.538 --> 08:19.707
<i>Takemichi Hanagaki.</i>

08:22.543 --> 08:25.004
<i>From that day on,</i>

08:25.004 --> 08:27.465
<i>I always followed you around.</i>

08:30.009 --> 08:32.094
- Takuya.
- Yeah?

08:32.094 --> 08:35.806
You know
how my heroes are hoodlums, right?

08:36.057 --> 08:38.684
When I get into middle school,

08:39.268 --> 08:41.646
I'll become
the number-one hoodlum in Japan.

08:41.646 --> 08:43.606
That's so ridiculous.

08:44.982 --> 08:47.902
The number-one hoodlum in Japan?

08:48.903 --> 08:50.696
How can they be heroes?

08:51.239 --> 08:52.573
HOODLUM

08:52.573 --> 08:54.784
<i>I researched what hoodlums were.</i>

08:57.453 --> 08:59.705
You're Osanai from Moebius, right?

09:00.289 --> 09:01.290
Yeah?

09:01.290 --> 09:03.834
<i>I even approached a real one.</i>

09:04.585 --> 09:07.672
<i>He was apparently
someone close to the top.</i>

09:08.047 --> 09:10.007
<i>But he wasn't number one in Japan.</i>

09:11.133 --> 09:12.885
<i>I did a lot of research.</i>

09:12.885 --> 09:16.138
<i>I gathered info
on all the hoodlums in the Kanto area</i>

09:16.138 --> 09:18.641
<i>and traveled to meet them.</i>

09:18.641 --> 09:22.353
<i>Then finally, I reached a certain guy.</i>

09:23.938 --> 09:27.149
<i>The leader of Tokyo Manji Gang,
Manjiro Sano.</i>

09:28.192 --> 09:30.861
<i>I found the beacon for my plan.</i>

09:33.322 --> 09:37.785
<i>In the summer of last year,
when I was about to execute my plan,</i>

09:38.452 --> 09:40.413
<i>I happened to see you.</i>

09:45.585 --> 09:48.087
<i>Look, Takemichi Hanagaki.</i>

09:49.255 --> 09:51.340
<i>I have completely changed</i>

09:51.924 --> 09:54.176
<i>for the woman that I love.</i>

09:57.513 --> 10:00.558
Haven't I seen that guy somewhere before?

10:05.938 --> 10:08.441
I will surpass you.

10:16.407 --> 10:18.784
<i>Becoming the number-one hoodlum in Japan,</i>

10:19.368 --> 10:22.246
<i>it's not a vague dream for me
like it is for you.</i>

10:24.123 --> 10:27.209
<i>I'll execute the plan
I've intricately worked out.</i>

10:27.793 --> 10:30.504
<i>I'll get what I need to make it happen.</i>

10:33.674 --> 10:36.135
You're Manjiro Sano, right?

10:38.679 --> 10:40.097
Who the heck are you?

10:41.849 --> 10:44.310
My name's Tetta Kisaki.

10:46.979 --> 10:50.983
<i>Without a doubt, Manjiro Sano
has the makings to be number one in Japan.</i>

10:50.983 --> 10:53.819
<i>He is the perfect puppet for me.</i>

10:53.819 --> 10:58.366
<i>He is the ideal vessel for me to use
to become the number-one hoodlum in Japan.</i>

10:58.866 --> 11:02.286
<i>The key player in the grand plan
that will take 10 years.</i>

11:02.912 --> 11:05.373
<i>One year to earn his trust.</i>

11:05.748 --> 11:09.794
<i>Another two years
to get to where I can manipulate him.</i>

11:10.503 --> 11:13.589
<i>Another three years
until we control Tokyo.</i>

11:14.090 --> 11:16.634
<i>And four years until we control Japan.</i>

11:17.468 --> 11:20.596
<i>10 years until I am called
number one in Japan.</i>

11:21.097 --> 11:25.309
Then I will succeed
in marrying Hinata Tachibana!

11:27.353 --> 11:29.230
<i>What I saw just now was</i>

11:29.605 --> 11:32.692
<i>the moment after he achieved
his selfish ambition...</i>

11:35.653 --> 11:36.904
<i>Hina...</i>

11:38.114 --> 11:39.949
<i>And then you...</i>

11:40.533 --> 11:42.284
But how many times

11:42.284 --> 11:45.121
did you get in my goddamn way, huh?

11:45.121 --> 11:47.957
How many times
did you travel through time, huh?

11:49.417 --> 11:53.838
Did you murder Hina
as vengeance for turning you down?

11:53.838 --> 11:55.381
Huh?

11:55.381 --> 11:59.176
Again and again and again!

11:59.176 --> 12:01.554
Tachibana is my woman!

12:01.554 --> 12:03.431
I won't let you have her!

12:03.431 --> 12:06.016
I'd rather kill her than let you have her.

12:06.016 --> 12:07.435
Why?

12:07.435 --> 12:09.103
I love her so much,

12:09.103 --> 12:12.064
so why won't she pay me any attention?

12:12.064 --> 12:14.024
The reason is you!

12:14.024 --> 12:16.152
Even though I respected you,

12:16.152 --> 12:17.653
you betrayed me.

12:18.154 --> 12:19.613
I should have...

12:20.114 --> 12:21.574
killed you sooner.

12:31.876 --> 12:33.335
Kisaki...

12:34.003 --> 12:36.839
I won't let you kill Hina anymore.

12:41.552 --> 12:43.637
<i>If this bastard is dead...</i>

12:50.394 --> 12:53.230
<i>...then Hina will be saved.</i>

13:04.492 --> 13:05.493
Takemichi!

13:13.751 --> 13:14.752
Hina...

13:16.003 --> 13:17.171
Takemichi.

13:36.023 --> 13:37.441
Takemitchy!

13:47.618 --> 13:49.161
Ow!

13:56.585 --> 13:57.670
You won't get away!

13:59.213 --> 14:01.674
Damn it!

14:02.216 --> 14:03.384
Damn it!

14:05.469 --> 14:06.804
You're through, Kisaki!

14:06.804 --> 14:09.181
Now that everyone knows what you're up to,

14:09.181 --> 14:12.601
nobody will ever trust you again!

14:12.768 --> 14:15.354
Your ambition has been destroyed!

14:15.354 --> 14:17.147
I won't let it end!

14:17.147 --> 14:19.441
I'll try as many times as it takes.

14:19.441 --> 14:22.570
Someday, Tachibana will be mine!

14:22.570 --> 14:24.363
Someday, I swear it!

14:25.531 --> 14:29.326
I won't let it happen!
I won't ever let that happen!

14:30.619 --> 14:32.037
<i>I swear he won't get away.</i>

14:32.621 --> 14:33.873
<i>I can't let him get away!</i>

14:34.456 --> 14:35.958
<i>Where's he trying to go?</i>

14:35.958 --> 14:38.752
<i>What is the trigger
that makes him time travel?</i>

14:38.752 --> 14:41.839
<i>I have to... I have to prevent it!</i>

14:43.132 --> 14:47.219
I can't ever let you
return to the future again!

14:59.481 --> 15:02.276
"Return to the future"?

15:05.821 --> 15:10.367
Do you think I'm a time traveler?

15:11.869 --> 15:13.078
Huh?

15:14.788 --> 15:16.081
You aren't?

15:24.089 --> 15:25.174
I...

15:46.111 --> 15:47.112
Hmm?

15:52.910 --> 15:54.912
I...

16:14.098 --> 16:15.474
Kisaki?

16:36.787 --> 16:39.164
Shit! What the hell is this?

16:39.164 --> 16:41.000
What's going on?

16:41.000 --> 16:42.710
I can't stand up!

16:50.592 --> 16:51.760
Damn it!

17:12.489 --> 17:13.741
I...

17:18.412 --> 17:21.248
Hey there, hero.

17:25.044 --> 17:27.671
Mikey!

17:28.881 --> 17:30.382
<i>Kisaki...</i>

17:30.382 --> 17:32.593
<i>He's been expelled.</i>

17:42.895 --> 17:44.188
I leave...

17:46.398 --> 17:47.775
...Toman

17:48.442 --> 17:49.443
in your hands.

17:55.574 --> 17:57.159
Thank you.

18:01.205 --> 18:02.414
Turn, and it's right there.

18:02.414 --> 18:03.957
Okay.

18:07.878 --> 18:09.713
Yeah, well,

18:09.713 --> 18:11.465
that's pretty normal.

18:14.468 --> 18:16.345
- Takuya.
- Yeah?

18:16.345 --> 18:19.348
I'll become
the number-one hoodlum in Japan.

18:25.354 --> 18:28.398
The hero has arrived!

18:30.818 --> 18:32.402
<i>I just wanted...</i>

18:34.071 --> 18:36.406
<i>to be like you.</i>

18:53.173 --> 18:55.092
I don't want to die.

19:05.978 --> 19:07.104
Kisaki...

19:21.201 --> 19:22.369
Don't look, Hina.

19:26.165 --> 19:28.041
Aw, crap.

19:28.917 --> 19:32.588
You know, you really are insanely strong,

19:33.422 --> 19:34.464
Draken.

19:36.884 --> 19:41.013
He's probably escaped by now.

19:43.849 --> 19:46.852
<i>This battle,
later called the Kanto Incident,</i>

19:47.603 --> 19:51.481
<i>was a clash of 500 people
between Yokohama's Tenjiku,</i>

19:52.149 --> 19:54.151
<i>Kanagawa's largest gang of hoodlums,</i>

19:54.610 --> 19:57.821
<i>and Tokyo Manji Gang,
Tokyo's biggest biker gang.</i>

19:58.906 --> 20:03.785
<i>It ended with the gruesome result
of five arrests and three deaths.</i>

20:05.037 --> 20:08.248
<i>The arrested were Tenjiku's five officers.</i>

20:09.875 --> 20:12.419
<i>The three dead were Emma Sano,</i>

20:13.921 --> 20:15.255
<i>Izana Kurokawa,</i>

20:16.965 --> 20:18.800
<i>and Tetta Kisaki.</i>

20:54.920 --> 20:56.004
Hey there,

20:56.505 --> 20:57.673
Kaku-chan.

21:00.884 --> 21:01.885
Ultimately,

21:03.011 --> 21:04.972
I was the only one who survived.

21:07.975 --> 21:09.810
Don't talk like that.

21:10.269 --> 21:12.771
How can Izana rest in peace
if you say that?

21:15.774 --> 21:17.192
Kisaki died too.

21:19.486 --> 21:22.864
Now the dreams of Tenjiku are through.

21:29.663 --> 21:32.499
That depends on you, Kaku-chan.

21:33.625 --> 21:35.002
On me, huh?

21:36.837 --> 21:37.963
Yes.

21:39.047 --> 21:40.507
Kisaki's dead.

21:41.550 --> 21:43.677
Now my fight is over.

21:44.761 --> 21:46.221
But...

21:46.805 --> 21:47.848
Huh?

21:49.266 --> 21:50.517
Even so...

21:51.435 --> 21:53.353
Since the day Kisaki died...

21:54.604 --> 21:57.858
I can't stop trembling.

23:39.751 --> 23:41.753
Translated by Brian Athey
